<title>USA: Agrium Inc sets $300 mln in three-tranche deal.</title>
<headline>Agrium Inc sets $300 mln in three-tranche deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three-tranche debt issue from Agrium Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER AGRIUM INC</p>
<p>AMT $75 MLN	  COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.678  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.059 PCT   PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 60 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.70 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2017</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.697  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.73 PCT    PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 85 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 7.80 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2027</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.655  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
